  "description": "Rooms / lobbies for SetNet, by composition (no base class). Create and join rooms by code, broadcast within a room, and get player-joined/left events — on a dedicated server (server is the hub; no relay needed). Pluggable room store (default in-memory), auto-leave on disconnect. Serializer-agnostic; depends only on SetNet.",
